                </TableHead>
                <TableHead className="h-10 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 px-6">
                  Артикул
                </TableHead>
                <TableHead className="h-10 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 px-6">
                  Тип
                </TableHead>
                <TableHead className="h-10 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 px-6">
                  Клиент (за продажба)
                </TableHead>
                <TableHead className="h-10 text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400 px-6 text-right">
